                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Am I the only one that finds the tiles hard to distinguise from each other when they are stacked? The colors at least in the first 10 puzzles are all flat white/yellow, or chinese character blue + red, and them being stacked I just dont see nothing anymore.\n\nI played a mobile mahjong game of which i was very fond (MahjongGames by DoraLogic), but that one doesnt come for Windows. And most other mahjong games for Windows look like they are made in the 90s.\n\nNot sure if I recommend, but I am forced to choose yes or no.",
